<tr>
	<th class="HDisplay1" align="center">Brewing Related</th>
</tr>
	
<tr>
			<td><img src="images/arm_bullet1.gif" WIDTH="8" HEIGHT="8">&nbsp;
			<a href="http://www.outofchaos.com/exg/" target="_new"><font size=4>EQ Brewers</font></a>
			&nbsp;Apparently not always 100% current, but has some good info nonetheless&nbsp;-&nbsp;<i>Morpeth Drongairfleit</i></td>
</tr>
		
<tr>
			<td><img src="images/arm_bullet1.gif" WIDTH="8" HEIGHT="8">&nbsp;
			<a href="http://www.eqtraders.com/" target="_new"><font size=4>EQ Traders</font></a>
			&nbsp;Offers a lot of information about where to get brewing supplies&nbsp;-&nbsp;<i>Morpeth Drongairfleit</i></td>
</tr>
		
<tr>
			<td><img src="images/arm_bullet1.gif" WIDTH="8" HEIGHT="8">&nbsp;
			<a href="http://pages.infinit.net/deeps/brewhome.htm" target="_new"><font size=4>Xyriel`s Guide to Brewing</font></a>
			&nbsp;Not as complete a brewing list as our own, but does have a good guide for new brewers, ingredient locations, and a great list of special foraged items by zone&nbsp;-&nbsp;<i>Morpeth Drongairfleit</i></td>
</tr>
			
<tr>
	<th class="HDisplay1" align="center">General</th>
</tr>
	
<tr>
			<td><img src="images/arm_bullet1.gif" WIDTH="8" HEIGHT="8">&nbsp;
			<a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/" target="_new"><font size=4>AllaKhazam`s Magical Realm</font></a>
			&nbsp;Another solid general EQ site. Has an excellent compilation of very detailed quest information, a nice equipment guide, and a page with links to homepages for guilds on all servers&nbsp;-&nbsp;<i>Morpeth Drongairfleit</i></td>
</tr>
		
<tr>
			<td><img src="images/arm_bullet1.gif" WIDTH="8" HEIGHT="8">&nbsp;
			<a href="http://eq.stratics.com/" target="_new"><font size=4>EQ Stratics</font></a>
			&nbsp;A good overall information site, that also has a materials pricing list for most brewing ingredients.&nbsp;-&nbsp;<i>Morpeth Drongairfleit</i></td>
</tr>
		
<tr>
			<td><img src="images/arm_bullet1.gif" WIDTH="8" HEIGHT="8">&nbsp;
			<a href="http://eqvault.ign.com/" target="_new"><font size=4>EQ Vault</font></a>
			&nbsp;A well-known site with lots of information for everyone.&nbsp;-&nbsp;<i>Morpeth Drongairfleit</i></td>
</tr>
		
<tr>
			<td><img src="images/arm_bullet1.gif" WIDTH="8" HEIGHT="8">&nbsp;
			<a href="http://www.everlore.com/" target="_new"><font size=4>Everlore</font></a>
			&nbsp;A great all-around site, with lots of information, including brewing. Also has a very nice beastiary - so you can find out what the heck just killed you...&nbsp;-&nbsp;<i>Morpeth Drongairfleit</i></td>
</tr>
		
<tr>
			<td><img src="images/arm_bullet1.gif" WIDTH="8" HEIGHT="8">&nbsp;
			<a href="http://www.station.sony.com/everquest/" target="_new"><font size=4>EverQuest</font></a>
			&nbsp;Verant/Sony`s official EQ site&nbsp;-&nbsp;<i>Morpeth Drongairfleit</i></td>
</tr>
		
<tr>
			<td><img src="images/arm_bullet1.gif" WIDTH="8" HEIGHT="8">&nbsp;
			<a href="http://eqbeastiary.allakhazam.com/" target="_new"><font size=4>Illia`s EverQuest Bestiary</font></a>
			&nbsp;A good site with MOB stats information, locations,  faction hits, and quest associations, if any.&nbsp;-&nbsp;<i>Morpeth Drongairfleit</i></td>
</tr>
		
		
<tr>
	<th class="HDisplay1" align="center">Maps</th>
</tr>
	
<tr>
			<td><img src="images/arm_bullet1.gif" WIDTH="8" HEIGHT="8">&nbsp;
			<a href="http://www.nx.sakura.ne.jp/~chizuya/index2e.html" target="_new"><font size=4>Chizua - Norrath Map Shop</font></a>
			&nbsp;A good site for maps.  All drawn by an Asian player, but they tend to be accurate, with /loc grids, etc.&nbsp;-&nbsp;<i>Psephas Bastinado</i></td>
</tr>
		
<tr>
			<td><img src="images/arm_bullet1.gif" WIDTH="8" HEIGHT="8">&nbsp;
			<a href="http://www.eqatlas.com/" target="_new"><font size=4>EQ Atlas</font></a>
			&nbsp;A wonderful site with dozens of detailed maps, with x,y coordinates, key features and adjacent zones. Plus MOB, vendor, trainer locations - as well as tips and FYI`s for each zone. Current and frequently updated.&nbsp;-&nbsp;<i>Morpeth Drongairfleit</i></td>
</tr>
		
<tr>
			<td><img src="images/arm_bullet1.gif" WIDTH="8" HEIGHT="8">&nbsp;
			<a href="http://www.eqmaps.com/" target="_new"><font size=4>EQ Maps</font></a>
			&nbsp;Another decent map site with good MOB drop information as well&nbsp;-&nbsp;<i>Morpeth Drongairfleit</i></td>
</tr>
		
<tr>
			<td><img src="images/arm_bullet1.gif" WIDTH="8" HEIGHT="8">&nbsp;
			<a href="http://www.tapr.org/~OutridersKarana/kunark/kunark.html" target="_new"><font size=4>Outriders of Karana Kunark Mapping Project</font></a>
			&nbsp;Kunark maps abound.&nbsp;-&nbsp;<i>Psephas Bastinado</i></td>
</tr>
		
	


<tr>
	<th class="HDisplay1" align="center">Equipment</th>
</tr>
	
<tr>
			<td><img src="images/arm_bullet1.gif" WIDTH="8" HEIGHT="8">&nbsp;
			<a href="http://www.pompano.net/~amylynn1/" target="_new"><font size=4>EQ Items</font></a>
			&nbsp;Very cool site, you can search for items based on the classes who can use them, slot, the stats they modify, item procs, etc.&nbsp;-&nbsp;<i>Morpeth Drongairfleit</i></td>
</tr>
		
<tr>
			<td><img src="images/arm_bullet1.gif" WIDTH="8" HEIGHT="8">&nbsp;
			<a href="http://www.eqprices.com" target="_new"><font size=4>EQ Prices</font></a>
			&nbsp;This site gives listing and server breakdowns of prices for EQ Items.  Good spot to check for ballpark prices.&nbsp;-&nbsp;<i>Rylos Darkmadrigal</i></td>
</tr>
		
<tr>
			<td><img src="images/arm_bullet1.gif" WIDTH="8" HEIGHT="8">&nbsp;
			<a href="http://www.battlezinc.com/eqwdb/" target="_new"><font size=4>EQ Weapons Database</font></a>
			&nbsp;Everything you could possibly ever want to know about EQ weapons, searchable by every category imaginable.&nbsp;-&nbsp;<i>Morpeth Drongairfleit</i></td>
</tr>
		
<tr>
			<td><img src="images/arm_bullet1.gif" WIDTH="8" HEIGHT="8">&nbsp;
			<a href="http://members.bellatlantic.net/~ewj/fletchguide/index.htm" target="_new"><font size=4>Fletching Guide by Aoenla</font></a>
			&nbsp;One of the most extensive sites around on fletching and bow making - costs, triviality, component stats, components locations, suggested sale prices, etc. etc&nbsp;-&nbsp;<i>Morpeth Drongairfleit</i></td>
</tr>
		
<tr>
			<td><img src="images/arm_bullet1.gif" WIDTH="8" HEIGHT="8">&nbsp;
			<a href="http://www.maximumeq.com/" target="_new"><font size=4>Maximum EQ</font></a>
			&nbsp;A well rounded and thorough site with something for everyone - but it`s best feature is a fantastic item database that shows going prices across servers.&nbsp;-&nbsp;<i>Morpeth Drongairfleit</i></td>
</tr>
			
